<title>JAPAN: Japan says no conclusion on aviation talks with US.</title>
<headline>Japan says no conclusion on aviation talks with US.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan and the United States ended Friday's unofficial talks in their civil aviation dispute without any specific conclusion, a Japanese official said.</p>
<p>He said the U.S. side would reply later on Friday evening on whether to continue the talks on Saturday.</p>
</text>
